```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization --help
Manage Scherzo Cloud organizations

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization [COMMAND]

Commands:
  create   Create a Scherzo Cloud organization
  list     List your Scherzo Cloud organization memberships
  show     Show a Scherzo Cloud organization
  update   Update a Scherzo Cloud organization
  members  Manage Scherzo Cloud organization members
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
